    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "やまおとこ　やまガールに　人気の商品。チタン素材を　使っているため　塩分を含む液体を　保存しても　錆びない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "등산가와 등산걸에게 인기 있는 상품. 티타늄 소재를 사용해서 염분이 있는 액체를 보관해도 녹이 슬지 않는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "受到登山男和登山女孩歡迎的商品。材質為鈦，因此即使存放含有鹽分的液體也不會生鏽。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un accessoire populaire auprès des Montagnards et Montagnardes. Sa structure en titane lui permet de contenir des liquides riches en sel sans rouiller.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese in der Wanderszene äußerst beliebte Trinkflasche besteht aus Titan und bleibt so selbst bei Aufbewahrung salzhaltiger Getränke rostfrei.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Popular entre Montañeros. Al estar hecho de titanio, no se oxida ni aunque dentro se lleven líquidos con alto grado de salinidad.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Articolo popolare tra Montanari e Montanare. Essendo realizzata in titanio placcato, non si arrugginisce nemmeno se usata per bevande che contengono sale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A popular option among hikers. It’s made with titanium, so it doesn’t rust even if it’s used to hold drinks with high sodium content.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "やまおとこ　やまガールに　人気の商品。チタン素材を　使っているため　塩分を含む液体を　保存しても　錆びない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在登山男与登山女孩之间很有人气的商品。使用钛制成，即使用来装含盐分的液体也不会生锈。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
